abstract: >-
  Unofficial DeepSeek Harness bundle that integrates Meta Muse Code models through
  the subscription: it declares the shipped Meta provider route for Settings > Models
  and the model picker, and adds the /muse-login command for the built-in device-code
  sign-in.
